# Boommobile's "Exhaust - {X}{2}{R}: This Vehicle deals X damage to any target. Put a +1/+1 counter on this Vehicle." has
# one target, so if it is gone as the ability resolves nothing happens, the counter included (CR 608.2b). Bot1 pays it
# for X=0 with three of the four mana its enters trigger made, aimed at Bot2's Llanowar Elves, and in response bolts the
# Elves with a Mountain: the exhaust resolves to nothing, and the fourth {R} is still there for abilities.

